title: "simaudit: scoped diagnostics for simulators"
type: software
version: 0.1.0a1
date-released: 2026-11-14
repository-code: "https://github.com/TesfayZ/simaudit"
keywords:
  - reinforcement learning
  - simulator validation
  - MuJoCo
  - Gymnasium
  - numerical verification
abstract: "Scoped, reproducible diagnostics for user-supplied simulators: parameter-assignment consistency, integrator-order convergence, release comparison and observation consistency, with explicit statements of what was not assessed."
